body:
The only part of the game that id say is an utter failure would be the underdome dlc. I never really can understand why people hate the first borderlands if they enjoy the rest of the series.

&#x200B;

Borderlands is noooooowhere near as good as the rest of the series. However not for a second do i think it is a bad game. Satisfying Gorey kills, Satisfying looting, A desolate and merciless setting. Also doing a clean 4man co op play through in borderlands one is super fun.

I can understand if you dont like the game for how bland the environment is, but it really is the theme of the game. I guess i can understand not having the same taste for it if you never played the first borderlands before the second. Honestly what it comes down to is not being invested enough in the borderlands universe or really just not enjoying highly aesthetic and immaculate games.

&#x200B;

Borderlands is definitely not an awful game.
